{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365680/extras/Intro.png?t=1740708635\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>NONEWORLD</strong> is a captivating RPG adventure set in strange universe caught in the grasps of destruction. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As a lost Princess from another world, you awaken in a strange, forgotten kingdom once full of life; now only a fading memory.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join forces with new allies, fight horrifying foes and destroy<i> a lot </i>of farmland in your journey to return home. But be warned: what seems cute at first may soon take a darker turn.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365680/extras/features.png?t=1740708635\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into a <i>haunting, hand-drawn</i> world with a captivating narrative and abstract characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play through <i>THREE</i> immersive story chapters, each packed with unique gameplay elements; each requiring roughly an hour to complete.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master a unique <i>turn-based battle system</i>, featuring nearly 100 powerful abilities and monsters straight out of your sleep paralysis episodes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As the <i>PRINCESS</i>, fight alongside three vibrant, fruity-colored protagonists; each with a distinct, lovable personality that adds flair to your journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore <i>open environments</i>, complete narrative quests and gather rare items to forge powerful equipment sets. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shape your fate with <i>TWO </i>distinct story endings, each offering an entirely different path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0 ...What's not to love?</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365680/extras/outro.png?t=1740708635\" /></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3365680?t=1740708635","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365680/5dbf1e2b931a6a3b4ef13e22531c787fc5818449/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1740708635","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365680/582164ee6c42daba6563cbc6cbe539c0ba1c4aab/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740708635","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365680/582164ee6c42daba6563cbc6cbe539c0ba1c4aab/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740708635","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365680/extras/Intro.png?t=1740708635\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>NONEWORLD</strong> is a captivating RPG adventure set in strange universe caught in the grasps of destruction. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As a lost Princess from another world, you awaken in a strange, forgotten kingdom once full of life; now only a fading memory.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join forces with new allies, fight horrifying foes and destroy<i> a lot </i>of farmland in your journey to return home. But be warned: what seems cute at first may soon take a darker turn.\u00a0</p><p class=\"b